WEBVTT

00:08:59.159 --> 00:09:04.039
Now I am aware that the algorithms
ubiquitous in everyday life

00:09:04.081 --> 00:09:08.544
are racist, sexist,
gendered, trivializing,

00:09:08.586 --> 00:09:12.214
stoke division, amplify bias.

00:09:13.048 --> 00:09:16.260
But what is this teaching us
about ourselves?

00:09:16.302 --> 00:09:17.553
AI is a tool.

00:09:17.595 --> 00:09:19.513
We are the ones who are using the tool.

00:09:20.681 --> 00:09:23.726
Hatred and contempt, money and power

00:09:23.726 --> 00:09:28.063
are human agendas, not AI agendas.

00:09:28.897 --> 00:09:33.444
We've been forced
to recognize the paucity,